{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a000000000000001","type":"group","x":-2460,"y":-1400,"width":1280,"height":1840,"color":"4","label":"Project Reading Entry"},
		{"id":"a000000000000002","type":"group","x":-900,"y":-1400,"width":2680,"height":980,"color":"5","label":"Pages / Components"},
		{"id":"a000000000000003","type":"group","x":-900,"y":-160,"width":5880,"height":760,"color":"2","label":"User Flow：审批单据主链路"},
		{"id":"a000000000000004","type":"group","x":-900,"y":840,"width":5880,"height":1180,"color":"6","label":"Domain Model / Registry"},
		{"id":"a000000000000005","type":"group","x":-2460,"y":720,"width":1280,"height":1600,"color":"3","label":"Folders / Modules + API"},
		{"id":"a000000000000006","type":"group","x":-900,"y":2300,"width":3280,"height":1220,"color":"1","label":"Nested Functions"},
		{"id":"a000000000000007","type":"group","x":2680,"y":2300,"width":2300,"height":1220,"color":"4","label":"Refactor Roadmap"},
		{"id":"a000000000000008","type":"group","x":5280,"y":-1400,"width":2300,"height":2520,"color":"1","label":"Key / Difficult Points"},
		{"id":"a000000000000009","type":"group","x":5280,"y":1320,"width":2300,"height":1000,"color":"1","label":"Questions / Needs Confirmation"},
		{"id":"b000000000000001","type":"text","x":-2320,"y":-1300,"width":1000,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 推荐阅读顺序\n\n1. `index.vue`：先看审批页总调度台。\n2. `approvalDisplay.js`：看列表卡片如何由 `bizType` 配置生成。\n3. `approvalDetailApi.js`：看 `bizType -> detailApi`。\n4. `ApprovalDetail.vue`：看拉详情、审批、撤回。\n5. `detailFields.js`：看详情字段适配。\n6. `flow.js`：看审批时间线适配。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000002","type":"file","x":-2320,"y":-820,"width":1000,"height":1120,"file":"ProjectInCompany/travelKnowledge/我的整理/Vue Components Communication 整理/DSL/审批单据领域模型与重构分析.md"},
		{"id":"b000000000000010","type":"text","x":-760,"y":-1280,"width":520,"height":520,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## `index.vue`\n\nRole:\n- 审批列表页和总调度台。\n- 负责显示列表、打开创建选择、打开申请弹窗、打开详情弹窗、处理撤回重提。\n\nDepends on:\n- `SelectApproval`\n- 多个申请弹窗组件\n- `ApprovalDetail`\n- 列表/提交/撤回相关方法\n\nAffects:\n- `createDialogVisible`\n- `docDialogVisible`\n- `docDialogMode`\n- `docDialogEditData`\n- `approvalDetailVisible`"},
		{"id":"b000000000000011","type":"text","x":-60,"y":-1280,"width":480,"height":300,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## `SelectApproval`\n\nRole:\n- 创建单据前的选择弹窗。\n\nCommunication:\n- `v-model:visible`\n- `@select=\"openDocDialog\"`\n\nAffects:\n- 选择结果交给父页面决定打开哪个申请弹窗。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000012","type":"text","x":560,"y":-1280,"width":520,"height":520,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 申请单据弹窗组件\n\nExamples:\n- `PurchaseApply`\n- `DailyReimburse`\n- `PurchaseReimburse`\n- `CardRepair`\n- `MaterialReceiveDialog`\n- `MaterialReturnDialog`\n\nRole:\n- 保留各自复杂 UI。\n- 接收 `mode/editData/form` 等 props。\n- 提交成功后 emit 给父页面刷新列表。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000013","type":"text","x":1220,"y":-1280,"width":420,"height":520,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## `ApprovalDetail.vue`\n\nRole:\n- 审批详情弹窗。\n- 负责拉详情、渲染详情字段、渲染审批流程、审批/拒绝、撤回。\n\nDepends on:\n- `detailApiMap`\n- `buildApprovalDetailFields`\n- `buildApprovalFlows`\n- `auditFormBase`\n\nAffects:\n- `@audited`\n- `@withdrawn`"},
		{"id":"b000000000000014","type":"text","x":-60,"y":-880,"width":1140,"height":280,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 组件通信总览\n\nParent -> Child:\n- `v-model:visible`\n- `mode`\n- `editData`\n- `form`\n- `deptOptions`\n- `data`\n\nChild -> Parent:\n- `@select`\n- `@submit`\n- `@submitted`\n- `@audited`\n- `@withdrawn`\n\nAnti-crossing note:\n- 这里用一个汇总节点承接通信关系，避免每个弹窗都拉回 `index.vue`。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000020","type":"text","x":-760,"y":0,"width":410,"height":340,"color":"2","text":"## Flow 1：创建入口\n\nUser:\n- 点击“创建单据”。\n\nResult:\n- `createDialogVisible = true`\n- 打开 `SelectApproval`。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000021","type":"text","x":-230,"y":0,"width":410,"height":340,"color":"2","text":"## Flow 2：选择单据类型\n\nComponent:\n- `SelectApproval`\n\nAction:\n- emit `select`\n- 父页面调用 `openDocDialog`。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000022","type":"text","x":300,"y":0,"width":410,"height":340,"color":"6","text":"## Inline State：弹窗状态\n\nOwner:\n- `index.vue`\n\nFields:\n- `docDialogVisible[dialogKey]`\n- `docDialogMode[dialogKey]`\n- `docDialogEditData[dialogKey]`\n\nWrite:\n- 新建/编辑/撤回重提时更新。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000023","type":"text","x":830,"y":0,"width":410,"height":340,"color":"2","text":"## Flow 3：申请弹窗提交\n\nComponent:\n- 各类申请弹窗。\n\nAction:\n- 校验表单。\n- 组装 payload。\n- 调提交接口。\n- emit `submitted`。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000024","type":"text","x":1360,"y":0,"width":410,"height":340,"color":"2","text":"## Flow 4：刷新列表\n\nParent:\n- `handleReimburseSubmitted`\n- `handleDocSubmitted`\n\nResult:\n- 关闭弹窗。\n- `fetchApprovalList`。\n- 列表重新渲染。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000025","type":"text","x":1890,"y":0,"width":410,"height":340,"color":"6","text":"## Inline Config：`bizType`\n\nMeaning:\n- 单据类型是整套领域模型的主键。\n\nReaders:\n- 列表卡片配置。\n- 详情接口映射。\n- 详情字段构造。\n- 审批流程构造。\n- 撤回重提映射。\n\nSee:\n- 下方 Registry 区。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000026","type":"text","x":2420,"y":0,"width":410,"height":340,"color":"2","text":"## Flow 5：点击列表卡片\n\nUser:\n- 点击某条审批卡片。\n\nResult:\n- 设置 `currentApprovalDetail`。\n- `approvalDetailVisible = true`。\n- 打开 `ApprovalDetail`。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000027","type":"text","x":2950,"y":0,"width":410,"height":340,"color":"3","text":"## Flow 6：拉详情\n\nFunction:\n- `fetchDetail()`\n\nSteps:\n1. 判断 `id/bizType`。\n2. `detailApiMap[bizType]`。\n3. loading = true。\n4. `await apiFn(id)`。\n5. 保存 `fetchedDetail`。\n6. finally 关 loading。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000028","type":"text","x":3480,"y":0,"width":410,"height":340,"color":"6","text":"## Inline State：`fetchedDetail`\n\nOwner:\n- `ApprovalDetail.vue`\n\nWrite:\n- `fetchDetail` 成功后写入。\n\nReaders:\n- `displayFields`\n- `displayFlows`\n- `handleAudit`\n- 最后节点特殊判断。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000029","type":"text","x":4010,"y":0,"width":410,"height":340,"color":"2","text":"## Flow 7：详情渲染 / 审批 / 重提\n\nComputed:\n- `displayFields`\n- `displayFlows`\n\nActions:\n- `handleAudit(status)`\n- `handleApprovalWithdrawn`\n\nResult:\n- 审批刷新列表。\n- 撤回后按映射回到编辑弹窗。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000030","type":"text","x":-760,"y":980,"width":520,"height":360,"color":"6","text":"## `bizType` 是主键\n\nMeaning:\n- 前端领域模型不是把所有单据变成一样。\n- 而是用 `bizType` 把单据差异挂到同一张地图。\n\nShape:\n```text\nbizType -> 展示/接口/字段/流程/弹窗/校验/撤回重提\n```"},
		{"id":"b000000000000031","type":"text","x":-100,"y":980,"width":560,"height":460,"color":"6","text":"## 建议：`approvalDocumentRegistry`\n\nRole:\n- 把同一个单据的规则收拢到一处。\n\nStart small:\n- `title`\n- `dialogKey`\n- `detailApi`\n- `canWithdraw`\n- `canResubmit`\n\nDo later:\n- `buildCardContent`\n- `auditRules`\n- `adapter`\n- `validate`\n\nAnti-crossing note:\n- 下方规则节点不再各自连回主流程，关系写在节点文本里。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000032","type":"text","x":620,"y":980,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"6","text":"## 列表卡片规则\n\nCurrent:\n- `approvalBizTypeConfig`\n\nOwns:\n- `title`\n- `type`\n- `dialog`\n- `buildContent(item)`\n\nFuture:\n- 可逐步并入 registry。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000033","type":"text","x":1280,"y":980,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"6","text":"## 详情接口规则\n\nCurrent:\n- `detailApiMap`\n\nShape:\n```js\nexpense_daily -> getDailyReimburseInfo\npurchase_apply -> getPurchaseApplyInfo\nposition_feedback -> getPositionFeedbackInfo\n```\n\nKey idea:\n- 接口可以不同，但入口要统一。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000034","type":"text","x":1940,"y":980,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"6","text":"## 详情字段规则\n\nCurrent:\n- `buildApprovalDetailFields`\n\nRole:\n- `bizType + detail` -> 可渲染字段。\n\nReturn:\n- 普通单据：`label/value` 行数组。\n- 复杂单据：结构化对象。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000035","type":"text","x":2600,"y":980,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"6","text":"## 审批流程规则\n\nCurrent:\n- `buildApprovalFlows`\n- `fixedInitiatorNameMap`\n\nRole:\n- 后端 `workflowConfig` -> 前端时间线节点。\n\nSpecial:\n- `position_feedback` 会提取处理结果和凭证。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000036","type":"text","x":3260,"y":980,"width":520,"height":300,"color":"6","text":"## 弹窗 / 审批 / 重提规则\n\nSuggested:\n- `toForm(detail)`\n- `validate(form)`\n- `toPayload(form, uploadedFileKey)`\n- `auditRules`\n- `canWithdraw/canResubmit/dialogKey`\n\nPurpose:\n- 保留复杂 UI。\n- 统一打开、回显、校验、提交和重提入口。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000040","type":"text","x":-2320,"y":860,"width":1000,"height":320,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 核心文件清单\n\n- `index.vue`：页面总调度台。\n- `approvalDisplay.js`：列表卡片配置。\n- `approvalDetailApi.js`：详情接口映射。\n- `ApprovalDetail.vue`：详情、审批、撤回。\n- `detailFields.js`：详情字段领域适配。\n- `flow.js`：审批流程领域适配。\n- `withdrawResubmit.js`：撤回重提弹窗映射。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000041","type":"text","x":-2320,"y":1280,"width":1000,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## API / Module 关系\n\nAPI 关系不再逐条拉长线。\n\nKey links:\n- `ApprovalDetail.fetchDetail()` 读 `detailApiMap`。\n- `buildApprovalDetailFields()` 读详情数据并生成展示字段。\n- `buildApprovalFlows()` 读 `workflowConfig` 并生成时间线。\n\nWhy:\n- 这些关系已经在主流程和 Registry 节点文字里说明。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000042","type":"text","x":-2320,"y":1740,"width":1000,"height":320,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## Store / LocalStorage 说明\n\nEvidence:\n- 当前 Markdown 主要分析审批领域模型、配置、接口、弹窗和重构路线。\n- 没有明确列出 store/localStorage 读写链路。\n\nDecision:\n- 本图不单独画 Store / Local Storage 区块，避免凭空补线。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000050","type":"text","x":-760,"y":2460,"width":560,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## `fetchDetail` 链\n\nCode shape:\n```text\nfetchDetail\n  -> guard id/bizType\n  -> detailApiMap[bizType]\n  -> loading = true\n  -> await apiFn(id)\n  -> fetchedDetail = res.data || res\n  -> loading = false\n```\n\nWhy important:\n- 这是详情页所有 computed 的数据源。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000051","type":"text","x":-60,"y":2460,"width":560,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## `handleAudit` 链\n\nCode shape:\n```text\nhandleAudit(status)\n  -> guard auditSubmitting\n  -> validate required fields\n  -> build auditParams\n  -> maybe auditParams.extra\n  -> auditFormBase(auditParams, true)\n```\n\nWhy important:\n- 同意、拒绝和岗位反馈特殊字段都在这里交汇。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000052","type":"text","x":640,"y":2460,"width":560,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 打开弹窗建议链\n\nCode shape:\n```text\nopenDocumentDialogByBizType(bizType, detail)\n  -> registry[bizType]\n  -> config.dialogKey\n  -> mode = detail ? 'edit' : 'create'\n  -> write editData\n  -> visible = true\n```\n\nPurpose:\n- 统一打开流程，不统一弹窗内部 UI。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000053","type":"text","x":1340,"y":2460,"width":560,"height":360,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 字段 / 流程构造链\n\nField:\n```text\nbizType + detail\n  -> buildApprovalDetailFields\n  -> renderable fields\n```\n\nFlow:\n```text\nworkflowConfig\n  -> buildApprovalFlows\n  -> timeline nodes\n```\n\nWhy important:\n- 这两个函数把后端原始数据转成前端可渲染模型。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000054","type":"text","x":-760,"y":2980,"width":1260,"height":300,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 回显 / 提交适配链\n\nCode shape:\n```text\ndetail -> toForm(detail) -> form\nform + uploadedFileKey -> validate(form)\nform + uploadedFileKey -> toPayload(form)\n```\n\nExample:\n- `dailyReimburseAdapter`\n\nWhy important:\n- 把后端字段兼容和提交参数整理从 UI 中拆出来。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000060","type":"text","x":2840,"y":2460,"width":460,"height":300,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 阶段 1：只整理，不大改\n\nGoal:\n- 让新人快速找到单据规则。\n\nDo:\n- 新建 `approvalDocumentRegistry.js`。\n- 先收拢 `title/dialogKey/detailApi/canWithdraw`。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000061","type":"text","x":3400,"y":2460,"width":460,"height":300,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 阶段 2：详情规则走 registry\n\nGoal:\n- 同一个 `bizType` 的列表、详情、流程从同一入口找。\n\nDo:\n- 卡片、详情接口、撤回重提逐步读 registry。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000062","type":"text","x":2840,"y":2920,"width":460,"height":300,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 阶段 3：抽弹窗适配器\n\nGoal:\n- 保留不同 UI，统一回显、校验、提交参数。\n\nStart:\n- `Daily.vue`\n- `Purchase.vue`"},
		{"id":"b000000000000063","type":"text","x":3400,"y":2920,"width":460,"height":300,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 阶段 4：处理重复工具\n\nGoal:\n- PC 和全端共用规则只维护一份。\n\nDo:\n- 对比 `flow.js` 和 `approvalUtils.js`。\n- Web 侧只 import。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000070","type":"text","x":5440,"y":-1280,"width":560,"height":380,"color":"1","text":"## Difficult Point：映射分散\n\nWhy it is hard:\n- 同一个 `bizType` 的规则散在多个文件。\n\nEvidence:\n- `approvalDisplay.js`\n- `approvalDetailApi.js`\n- `withdrawResubmit.js`\n- `flow.js`\n- `detailFields.js`\n- `index.vue`\n\nRisk:\n- 新增单据或改规则时容易漏一个位置。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000071","type":"text","x":6160,"y":-1280,"width":560,"height":380,"color":"1","text":"## Difficult Point：`index.vue` 调度过重\n\nWhy it is hard:\n- 页面同时管列表、弹窗、详情、撤回重提、提交回调。\n\nEvidence:\n- 模板里挂了多个申请弹窗。\n- 弹窗状态、模式、回显数据都在父页面。\n\nHow to read:\n- 先把它当“总调度台”。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000072","type":"text","x":5440,"y":-760,"width":560,"height":380,"color":"1","text":"## Difficult Point：复杂弹窗不能万能化\n\nWhy it is hard:\n- 采购申请、物料领用、员工录入的 UI 和业务限制差异很大。\n\nEvidence:\n- 文档明确建议保留独立组件。\n\nRisk:\n- 强行统一会变成大量分支。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000073","type":"text","x":6160,"y":-760,"width":560,"height":380,"color":"1","text":"## Difficult Point：岗位反馈最后节点\n\nWhy it is hard:\n- 审批弹窗里混入了具体单据业务规则。\n\nEvidence:\n- `showPositionFeedbackFinalFields`\n- `handleAudit` 校验处理结果和凭证。\n\nRefactor idea:\n- 放进 `auditRules`。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000074","type":"text","x":5440,"y":-240,"width":560,"height":380,"color":"1","text":"## Difficult Point：流程工具重复\n\nWhy it is hard:\n- 两处实现类似流程判断，会导致修一边漏一边。\n\nEvidence:\n- `flow.js` 有当前节点和最后节点判断。\n- `approvalUtils.js` 也有类似函数。\n\nRisk:\n- PC、移动端或不同页面表现不一致。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000075","type":"text","x":6160,"y":-240,"width":560,"height":380,"color":"1","text":"## Difficult Point：回显字段兼容\n\nWhy it is hard:\n- 后端详情字段不统一，前端需要兜底。\n\nEvidence:\n- `fillForm` 使用 `applicantId || accountId || createBy`。\n\nRefactor idea:\n- 每个单据抽 `toForm / validate / toPayload`。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000080","type":"text","x":5440,"y":1460,"width":940,"height":280,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 待确认 1：源码证据范围\n\nEvidence:\n- 本 canvas 根据 `审批单据领域模型与重构分析.md` 绘制。\n- 没有重新逐行读取真实源码。\n\nUse:\n- 它是阅读地图，不是最终重构 diff。"},
		{"id":"b000000000000081","type":"text","x":5440,"y":1820,"width":940,"height":280,"color":"#ffffff","text":"## 待确认 2：registry 迁移范围\n\nQuestion:\n- 第一阶段只收拢 `title/dialogKey/detailApi/canWithdraw` 是否足够？\n\nAdvice:\n- 先选 `expense_daily` 做样板，再推广到其他 `bizType`。"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"c000000000000001","fromNode":"b000000000000001","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"b000000000000002","toSide":"top","toEnd":"arrow","label":"source note"},
